Description:

The new ``Mailbox/markAllEmailRead`` JMAP method, part of the Cyrus Mail
extension, marks all email in another user's mailboxes as seen for the
caller in one call, rather than one ``Email/set`` update per email.  It
logs one new ``auditlog.touched.bulk`` line per mailbox, with the number
and uids of the emails changed, in place of an ``auditlog.touched`` line
per email.


